note Exercism-style exercise "hamming": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/hamming
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note distance is the number of positions at which DNA strands a and b differ,
note or -1 when they are not of equal length.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/hamming
om2
fn distance a view uchar * b view uchar * to long
if ne len a len b
ret -1
end
d = long 0
for i ulong len a
if ne get a i get b i
d = add d 1
end
end
ret d
end
